            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "9928e2a69e79bc54a6f8e2ec35d6f5e64958880512ba94f5c8efcffefb634aaf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9928e2a69e79-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case concerns the constitutionality of the 1995 amendment to Section 409, which protects data compiled for federal highway funding from being used in litigation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court Transcript",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9928e2a69e79bc54a6f8e2ec35d6f5e64958880512ba94f5c8efcffefb634aaf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9928e2a69e79-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The amendment is argued to serve an important federal interest in ensuring accurate and complete information for awarding federal highway funds."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9928e2a69e79bc54a6f8e2ec35d6f5e64958880512ba94f5c8efcffefb634aaf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9928e2a69e79-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, the case raises the question whether Congress's judgment on the matter deserves substantial deference."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. MUNGIA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9928e2a69e79bc54a6f8e2ec35d6f5e64958880512ba94f5c8efcffefb634aaf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9928e2a69e79-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "9928e2a69e79bc54a6f8e2ec35d6f5e64958880512ba94f5c8efcffefb634aaf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9928e2a69e79-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. MUNGIA, the discussion also addresses whether conditions on federal highway funding may be authorized under the Spending Clause."
      }
    ],
